" for what may be the same ticket. Please confirm the real ticket and its history in the system.\n\nSources with no ticket number: the Mar 2025 digest (gate check-in email), the Aug 3 2026 digest (Hartford Sev 1 incident, no number given), and the Dec 2025 digest (dispatch duplicate entries). I left out Vantorre Mobility items, such as #4812.","thread_ts":"1792159200.000125"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126","thread_ts":"1792159200.000125"}}
